export anchor SalesGraphiteStyle:
    number: 334
    screen: CrmPipeline
    name: Sales graphite
    idea: A sober working CRM in cool graphite, with one summary strip, five even stage columns of clean deal cards and a single teal accent for progress and action.
    base: dark
    palette:
        page: #15171a, the page background and the style sheet
        column: #1c1f23, the top bar, summary strip, stage columns and activity panel
        card: #24282d, deal cards, secondary buttons and list rows
        line: #343941, every border, divider and meter track
        ink: #eceef1, text and figures
        muted: #a3aab4, labels, owners, counts and stage totals
        teal: #6fd6c4, the primary button, current tab, target meter and focus
        onTeal: #0c2622, text on teal
        amber: #f3c46f, Stalled text and its warning triangle
        sky: #9ec5ff, next step and closing text with calendar and flag
        green: #8fdca0, Won and Closed text with a check
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue,
        Arial, with figures in ui-monospace, SF Mono, Menlo, Consolas. Base
        14px at 1.5. The page title is 22px at 650, summary figures 22px
        mono at 600 with tabular numbers, deal names 14px at 600, column
        heads 13px at 650 and meta 12px.
    layout:
        A 56px top bar holds a teal square B mark with Brightwork Sales,
        four underlined tabs with Pipeline current, then search and a teal
        New deal button. Below sits the title Deal pipeline with a round Q4
        chip and an All owners button on the right. One bordered summary
        strip splits into five cells, Pipeline value, Won this quarter with
        of 200,000 and 64 percent beside it and a thin teal meter under it,
        Target, Win rate and Open deals. Five equal stage columns follow,
        each with a 3px top rule that steps from grey to teal to green, a
        head with stage name, count and total in mono. Deal cards show the
        name and value on one line, an initials disc with the owner, and a
        ruled status line with an icon. Recent activity sits below as one
        panel split into three cells. Below 1100px the board goes to three
        columns, below 760px to one, the tabs scroll, search hides and the
        summary goes two by two with the won cell on top.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 12px gaps between columns and cards, 12px card padding, 28px page gutter, 16px on phones.
    density: Medium. Every deal is a card with name, value, owner and one status line.
    corners: 8px panels and columns, 6px cards, buttons and fields, round initials and chip.
    borders: 1px #343941 on every surface, plus the 3px stage top rule on each column.
    shadows: A faint 0 1px 2px black under deal cards only.
    icons:
        Rounded line icons at 1.9 stroke, sized to the text. Calendar for
        the next step, paper plane for sent, warning triangle for stalled,
        flag for closing, check for won, phone and eye in the activity.
    focus: A 2px solid teal outline offset 2px on every control and around the search field.
    tone: Plain CRM words, such as Deal pipeline, New deal, All owners and Recent activity.
